OL,3,GNEWSAFather-of-three whose death
OL,4,Asparked murder probe named
OL,5,
OL,6,FA photo has been released of a
OL,7,Ffather-of-three whose death at a block
OL,8,Fof flats prompted a murder
OL,9,Finvestigation.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police said the body
OL,12,Ffound on 24 September in The Foyer on
OL,13,FStoke Road, Slough, had now been
OL,14,Fformally identified as 48-year-old
OL,15,FMarcin Jankowski.
OL,17,FA post-mortem examination conducted on
OL,18,FTuesday indicated his death had been
OL,19,Fthe result of blunt force trauma.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
