OL,3,GNEWSAFather-of-three whose death
OL,4,Asparked murder probe named
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men from Slough - aged 45 and 53 -
OL,7,Fwere arrested on suspicion of murder on
OL,8,FWednesday. They have since been
OL,9,Freleased on bail while the
OL,10,Finvestigation continues.
